  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovating quality teacher training in Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The educational authorities of the new Government in Guatemala 2024-2027 have requested the support of UNESCO for promoting innovation in the initial and continuing training of Guatemalan teachers and other teacher policies, which will have a positive impact on the country&apos;s educational quality. The project will include support to national teacher training institutions. The technical support of the UNESCO Guatemala Office for the new educational authorities may be provided through updated information about the ITT in Guatemala.</narrative>
  </description>
